    {
      "id": "awRCXQVbjVqnVWz0S0Sda",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7677.321710037335,
      "y": 1939.1809382997849,
      "width": 616.2012634277344,
      "height": 360,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bk5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 72161202,
      "version": 973,
      "versionNonce": 2098696622,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1734087999366,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional (What)\n- Dataset Visualization\n    - Datasets\n        - List (Multiple)\n        - Request Form\n            - Date Selector (Min/Max Restriction, MM/YY)\n            - Region\n                - Type (Drop-Down: City, 3-Zip, 5-Zip)\n                - Location (Search, Clear)\n            - Percentile (Drop-Down: Bottom, Middle, Top)\n            - Tool-tip (Question Mark)\n    - Plot Graph\n        - Plot Datasets\n        - Zoom, Drag, Screenshot\n        - Multi-lines\n        - Axes, Grids, Labels\n- About\n    - GitHub Link",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "MiBPf5ex7JSKso4pvjVrN",
      "originalText": "Functional (What)\n- Dataset Visualization\n    - Datasets\n        - List (Multiple)\n        - Request Form\n            - Date Selector (Min/Max Restriction, MM/YY)\n            - Region\n                - Type (Drop-Down: City, 3-Zip, 5-Zip)\n                - Location (Search, Clear)\n            - Percentile (Drop-Down: Bottom, Middle, Top)\n            - Tool-tip (Question Mark)\n    - Plot Graph\n        - Plot Datasets\n        - Zoom, Drag, Screenshot\n        - Multi-lines\n        - Axes, Grids, Labels\n- About\n    - GitHub Link",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
