      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Header\n- IconButton (NavDrawer)\n- IconButton (AppLogo)\n- TextButton (App)\n- IconButton (GithubLink)\n- Toggle (ThemeToggle)\n\nDynamicList\n- ListHeader\n    - Text (Title)\n    - IconButton (DrawerToggle)\n- ListItems\n    - Item\n        - CollapsedItem\n            - Text (Name)\n            - IconButton (Expand)\n        - ExpandedItem\n            - Text (Name)\n            - IconButton (Collapse)\n            - ItemDetails\n                - Label\n                - Text\n        - AddItem\n- Scrollbar\n\nAddListItemModal\n- Form",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Header\n- IconButton (NavDrawer)\n- IconButton (AppLogo)\n- TextButton (App)\n- IconButton (GithubLink)\n- Toggle (ThemeToggle)\n\nDynamicList\n- ListHeader\n    - Text (Title)\n    - IconButton (DrawerToggle)\n- ListItems\n    - Item\n        - CollapsedItem\n            - Text (Name)\n            - IconButton (Expand)\n        - ExpandedItem\n            - Text (Name)\n            - IconButton (Collapse)\n            - ItemDetails\n                - Label\n                - Text\n        - AddItem\n- Scrollbar\n\nAddListItemModal\n- Form",
